in kernel</strong> =E2=80=94 KV-stationary, persistent; emits partials (O_p=
artial, m, l).</li><li class=3D"[&amp;_ol]:mt-2 [&amp;_ul]:mt-2"><strong cl=
ass=3D"font-semibold">Combine</strong> =E2=80=94 LSE-merge each query=E2=80=
=99s partials into the final output.</li></ol><div><h4 id=3D"sparse-attenti=
on-kernel-pipeline-design" class=3D"font-inter font-medium text-headline te=
xt-rich-h4"><strong class=3D"font-semibold">Sparse attention kernel pipelin=
e design</strong></h4></div><p class=3D"">The sparse attention main kernel =
is warp-specialized: <strong class=3D"font-semibold">load</strong> (K/V via=
